      "chunk_index": 0,
      "total_chunks_in_note": 1,
      "text": "[Apex Retail Corporation | FY2024 | Note 2 - Inventories and Stock Valuation]\n\nNote 2: Inventories and Stock Valuation\nInventories are stated at the lower of cost and net realizable value using the First-In, First-Out (FIFO) method. As of December 31, 2024, finished merchandise was USD 58.1 million and goods in transit totaled USD 6.4 million. A reserve of USD 2.1 million was maintained for obsolete and slow-moving retail inventory.",
