      "chunk_index": 0,
      "total_chunks_in_note": 1,
      "text": "[Apex Retail Corporation | FY2024 | Note 3 - Tangible Fixed Assets and Depreciation]\n\nNote 3: Tangible Fixed Assets and Depreciation\nTangible fixed assets are stated at cost less accumulated depreciation. Store fixtures and equipment are depreciated over 5 to 10 years, and warehouse facilities over 25 years on a straight-line basis. Depreciation charge for 2024 was USD 9.4 million.",
